.Dd September 7, 2026
.Dt INFOCMP 1
.Os FreeLinX
.Sh NAME
.Nm infocmp
.Nd compare or print out terminfo descriptions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm infocmp
.Op Fl 1x
.Op Fl T Ar terminal
.Op Ar terminal ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
compares or prints out terminfo descriptions.
With a single
.Ar terminal
argument, it prints the description in terminfo source format;
with two, it shows what differs between them.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl 1
Print each capability on its own line.
.It Fl T Ar terminal
Use the named terminal instead of the
.Ev TERM
environment variable.
.It Fl x
Print extended (non-standard) capabilities.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr terminfo 5 ,
.Xr tput 1
.Sh HISTORY
An
.Nm
command appeared in SVR2.